# Written by installing torgash.commerceml and deleted by uninstalling it —
# the address 1C's own instructions hard-code, which only answers if a file of
# that name exists. Not source: whether it is there is a fact about this
# installation, not about the engine. See Torgash\CommerceMl\LegacyEndpoint.
